+      Use kind=policy for questions about what the shop allows, requires, or supports,
+      including hypothetical scenarios and general eligibility questions. Select only
+      the policy_topics needed to answer them. A customer can ask about policy even
+      if they give an email or mention their account status.
+      Do not treat a policy question as permission to make a change or issue a refund.
+      A request to take action on a particular purchase or account is not a policy
+      question, even if phrased politely as a question or missing an order number.
+      Use kind=other for status checks on specific orders or past refunds: asking what
+      happened is not a request to issue a refund. Leave policy_topics empty for
+      non-policy requests.
 
